  "body": "### Value Prop\n\nSecurity overview will include code scanning status information for all repositories within the organization.\n\nUsers will see a color coded identification of \"green,\" \"yellow,\" or \"red\" next to each repository in the organization. These indicators represent the status of the code scanning tool's setup and performance. Customers can access the repository to enhance the tool's performance.\n\n### Expected Outcome\n\nThe feature will streamline code scanning setup and adoption. When users enable code scanning across an organization at scale, they can identify repositories where a code scanning tool is underperforming or malfunctioning and take corrective measures. \n",
